    "title": "Thousands join anti-Trump protests in the UK | DW News",
    "text": "The United Kingdom has rolled out the red carpet for Donald Trump, who has become the first US President to receive two official state receptions. President Trump and his wife Melania sat down to a lavish banquet at Windsor Castle, following an afternoon of pagentry and parades. But not everyone in the UK has been quite as welcoming.\n00:00 Trump greeted by king, thousands of protesters in UK visit\n03:03 Jon Alterman, Center for Strategic and International Studies\n07:06 Natasha Lindstaedt, University of Essex\nFor more news go to: http://www.dw.com/en/\nFollow DW on social media:\n►Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/dwnews\n►TikTok: https://www.tiktok.com/@dwnews\n►Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/deutschewellenews/\n►Twitter: https://twitter.com/dwnews\nFür Videos in deutscher Sprache besuchen Sie: https://www.youtube.com/dwdeutsch\nSubscribe: https://www.youtube.com/user/deutschewelleenglish?sub_confirmation=1\n#Trump #UK #Windsor",
